# The wasm-bindgen `web` build of libssruntime (the Brain), bundled as a Flutter
# asset for the web target. Built from the SpriteStudio-SDK submodule — NOT
# committed, exactly like the native dylibs under ssruntime_dart/native/libs.
# ssruntime_bg.wasm is the SIMD build; *.nosimd.wasm is the fallback for engines
# without stable WASM SIMD (loadSsRuntime picks one at runtime). One shared JS
# glue (ssruntime.js) drives either binary. Regenerate with:
#     scripts/build-runtime.sh platform=web
ssruntime.js
ssruntime_bg.wasm
ssruntime_bg.nosimd.wasm
